Lumiera for Debian
------------------

This is a preview of the Debian packaging for Lumiera.
As of 2025, Lumiera is in early development and not usable yet.

The Application will allow to edit footage in the common multimedia formats
and enable non-destructive editing and compositing.

See
 - for the Vision: https://Lumiera.org/documentation/user/intro/intro.html
 - current goals: https://Lumiera.org/documentation/design/governance/integration.html
 - test/demo functionality in this development preview:
   https://Lumiera.org/documentation/user/manual.html

The Debian packaging will be maintained by the Lumiera core developer team --
Indeed, Debian/stable is defined as reference system for Lumiera development.
When additional libraries are required beyond what is available in Debian/stable,
the Lumiera team will provide backports or custom Debian packages.
See https://Lumiera.org/debian for our DEB repository.

